{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roads never end, and the traffic never stops. Your only goal: make it across.<br><br>Grab up to 5 friends and take on 12 chaotic levels, each packed with speeding cars, tricky hazards, and hidden secrets. Time your crossings carefully and try not to get flattened, though watching a friend get launched by a car might be the funniest part. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides collectible eggs for the curious, and over 20 hats can be unlocked as you play. Survive the roads, explore the levels, and show off your style.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gem Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010150/982e9d8856328071e1ee6bb2b169661d658c93e6.jpg"},{"name":"All Levels Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010150/dd02655f512b642a01f3bfdb1fe9fc8235761fca.jpg"},{"name":"Hat Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010150/97d9422599080d85e0d430aa9d52163a36e9c351.jpg"},{"name":"Founder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010150/125720ed4a5d4ede086f8e32a80cc765573fc8c5.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010150?t=1762843615","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010150/01ebc1ff74510ea5c1cd6b23b7c777b8200df510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762843615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010150/568d6b23cbfd351327e16afc88bcd34f7fa2ab82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762843615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010150/568d6b23cbfd351327e16afc88bcd34f7fa2ab82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762843615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online